    <code code="10187-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Review of systems Narrative"/>
    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><paragraph>Positive for the concerns in the history of present illness. Alert, warm and cooperative; speech normal; thought process organized; no psychotic features; no history of manic or hypomanic episodes. Mood low, worse in the days around her period; tearful when describing missed work; PHQ-9 score 12 with item 9 scored 0; GAD-7 8; no thoughts of suicide or self-harm, now or in the past. No other systems reported as affected in this synthetic episode. [S]</paragraph></text>

